# Build context for infrastructure/docker/*.Dockerfile (context = repository root).
# Keep every path those Dockerfiles COPY: lockfiles, package.json files, packages/*, apps/* sources, docs/,
# infrastructure/runbooks, infrastructure/docker/Caddyfile, config/models, datasets/, pyproject.toml, uv.lock.

# VCS, editor and agent state
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.cursor
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store

# Credentials and local configuration (never part of an image)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials
**/credentials.json
**/*service-account*.json
.aws
.npmrc.local

# Dependencies and virtual environments (images install from the lockfiles)
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# Generated builds and caches (rebuilt inside the images)
**/dist
**/dist-worker
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/.astro
apps/docs/src/content/docs
apps/docs/public/media
apps/docs/csp
*.log
**/*.log

# Infrastructure-as-code state and deployment configuration
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/crash*.log
infrastructure/terraform
infrastructure/perf/results
infrastructure/aws/config/*.env
!infrastructure/aws/config/*.example

# Local data, test output and notebooks (not image inputs)
.data
backups
apps/api/uploads
playwright-report
**/test-results
apps/web/playwright/.auth
notebook-runs
ml-notebooks
datasets/evaluation/results/smoke
datasets/evaluation/results/*.tmp
